{"resourceIdentifier":"2971","resourceName":"OKA 2 PROJECT","description":"This savannah Land Afforestation Project on the Batéké Plateau north of Brazzaville aims to develop an alternative and renewable source of charcoal for urban use, based on the establishment of Acacia auriculiformis plantations. Furthermore, Acacia rows will be intercropped with lines of food crops (Cassava in particular), forming agroforestry plantations. \r\nWe also know that another effective tool to combat global warming are 'carbon sink' plantations, i.e. plantations where trees are not harvested, in order to maximize greenhouse gas sequestration in the long term. Half of the project's area will therefore be dedicated to Acacia mangium plantations with the main objective of CO2 sequestration.\r\nThese plantations will be set up in anthropogenic savannahs, i.e. land with a biomass stock blocked at a very low stage due to recurrent bushfires. The savannahs are deliberately set to fire at frequent intervals (at least once a year) by villagers to facilitate agricultural, pastoral and cynegetic activities.\r\nAs a result, the Project will have several social and environmental benefits such as (1) CO2 sequestration on land that is currently non-forested and unused, (2) Less pressure on the surrounding natural forests, thanks to the production of charcoal from sustainably managed plantations, (3) Job creation in a territory heavily affected by unemployment, increased incomes. As such, the project acts as a driving force of local development and fights against rural exodus or (4) Increased farming production and productivity, contributing to the economic development of local communities.","location":{"latitude":-3.622304,"longitude":15.334925},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-05-09","endExclusive":"2022-06-09","endInclusive":"2022-06-08"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2971"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Batéké Plateaus"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Acacia Bateke Capital"},{"type":"string","value":"Hérault, France"},{"type":"string","value":"+33(0)467200809"},{"type":"string","value":"CARBON@frm-france.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2971"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2971"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"19976"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":2520}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-ACM0003"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2400 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AENOR CONFIA, S.A. (UNIPERSONAL)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"29/03/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/08/2020 - 31/07/2053"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=64694&IDKEY=k097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn87089213026","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"20210921VCS_PDD_OddoOkaEcole2_v1.1_Clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-04-11T12:29:14.293Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=61551&IDKEY=dlksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098u84878829","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation-ODDOb.pdf","uploadDate":